{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue the adventure of <strong>Tiny Lands</strong> finding the differences, this time with a lot of new things! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Lands 2</strong> brings finding the differences to the next level! Dioramas mix photorealistic daily objects in 3D, explore from any angle stunning visual scenes with a real sense of handcrafting, and enjoy beautiful experiences with a refreshing visual aesthetic to relax and chill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New ways of looking at things! </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can explore the dioramas at more angles with more freedom with an orbital camera and multi-directional panning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bccadb9b8bea5be06c9e76583f1bc3d3.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" aria-label=\"Orbital exploration\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bccadb9b8bea5be06c9e76583f1bc3d3.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bccadb9b8bea5be06c9e76583f1bc3d3.mp4?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden jigsaw pieces across the scenes, collect them all and discover what will happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bb71f852d29d0edd0ff2ad5070da92be.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bb71f852d29d0edd0ff2ad5070da92be.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bb71f852d29d0edd0ff2ad5070da92be.mp4?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Photo-Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy and get creative with the new photo mode; use borders, stickers, and other camera effects to share your creations, funny situations, and inspiring masterpieces\u00a0with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/120e301cb960c95dbbfcfc26140ecdfe.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" aria-label=\"Photo Mode\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/120e301cb960c95dbbfcfc26140ecdfe.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/120e301cb960c95dbbfcfc26140ecdfe.mp4?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play together locally!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to two players can enjoy Tiny Lands now!<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/c7e44ab327fae6ec1092586036440422.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" aria-label=\"TwoPlayer\" width=270 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/c7e44ab327fae6ec1092586036440422.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take it easy and relax at your own tempo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time limit; set your favorite chill music and play at your own pace. Tiny Lands 2 still applies our \u201cno punishment\u201d policy, so grab a cup of coffee and chill out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Hint system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you get stuck on a difference, we included a hint aid system that will mark a radial zone where the difference might be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/18a3e153496033deb0271919ffa0d0ce.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" aria-label=\"Hint system \" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/18a3e153496033deb0271919ffa0d0ce.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/18a3e153496033deb0271919ffa0d0ce.mp4?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Accessibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have included 3 types of colorblindness support:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deuteranopia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tritanopia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protanopia</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/83a694e8ba02c5e36898bd46924dbc47.avif?t=1760710980\" alt=\"Accesibility\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope this can ease the game experience for people who deal with this type of colorblindness and enjoy the game like everyone!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 Have fun in Tiny Lands 2! \u2661</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2213330?t=1760710980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760710980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/bfdaeca60fd32f1dd848c31620634b8f469c4ae4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760710980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/bfdaeca60fd32f1dd848c31620634b8f469c4ae4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760710980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue the adventure of <strong>Tiny Lands</strong> finding the differences, this time with a lot of new things! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Lands 2</strong> brings finding the differences to the next level! Dioramas mix photorealistic daily objects in 3D, explore from any angle stunning visual scenes with a real sense of handcrafting, and enjoy beautiful experiences with a refreshing visual aesthetic to relax and chill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New ways of looking at things! </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can explore the dioramas at more angles with more freedom with an orbital camera and multi-directional panning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bccadb9b8bea5be06c9e76583f1bc3d3.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" aria-label=\"Orbital exploration\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bccadb9b8bea5be06c9e76583f1bc3d3.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bccadb9b8bea5be06c9e76583f1bc3d3.mp4?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden jigsaw pieces across the scenes, collect them all and discover what will happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bb71f852d29d0edd0ff2ad5070da92be.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bb71f852d29d0edd0ff2ad5070da92be.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/bb71f852d29d0edd0ff2ad5070da92be.mp4?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Photo-Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy and get creative with the new photo mode; use borders, stickers, and other camera effects to share your creations, funny situations, and inspiring masterpieces\u00a0with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/120e301cb960c95dbbfcfc26140ecdfe.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" aria-label=\"Photo Mode\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/120e301cb960c95dbbfcfc26140ecdfe.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/120e301cb960c95dbbfcfc26140ecdfe.mp4?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play together locally!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to two players can enjoy Tiny Lands now!<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/c7e44ab327fae6ec1092586036440422.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" aria-label=\"TwoPlayer\" width=270 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/c7e44ab327fae6ec1092586036440422.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take it easy and relax at your own tempo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time limit; set your favorite chill music and play at your own pace. Tiny Lands 2 still applies our \u201cno punishment\u201d policy, so grab a cup of coffee and chill out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Hint system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you get stuck on a difference, we included a hint aid system that will mark a radial zone where the difference might be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/18a3e153496033deb0271919ffa0d0ce.poster.avif?t=1760710980\" aria-label=\"Hint system \" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/18a3e153496033deb0271919ffa0d0ce.webm?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/18a3e153496033deb0271919ffa0d0ce.mp4?t=1760710980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Accessibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have included 3 types of colorblindness support:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deuteranopia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tritanopia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protanopia</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/extras/83a694e8ba02c5e36898bd46924dbc47.avif?t=1760710980\" alt=\"Accesibility\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope this can ease the game experience for people who deal with this type of colorblindness and enjoy the game like everyone!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 Have fun in Tiny Lands 2! \u2661</p>","developers":["Hyper Three Studio"],"dlc":[4047610],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/header.jpg?t=1760710980","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Hyper Three Studio All rights reserved. Licensed to and published by Hidden Trap and TrueColor Games.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steams